# Frontend production core

Source of truth: `Rules/FRONTEND_PRODUCTION_ENGINEERING_RULES.md`.

- Implement real end-to-end behavior. No dummy data, fake API success, fabricated counters, TODO branches, or dead buttons.
- If contracts, credentials, backend, or DB are missing: **STOP** that slice; document the blocker; do not invent success.
- Inspect existing routes, styles, fonts, and configs before editing.
- Prefer the smallest complete vertical slice. No speculative scaffolding.
- Report only verified results from actual checks. Never claim production-ready without evidence.
